{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10","index":10,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lù","traditional":"路","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"问","pinyin":"wèn","traditional":"問","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Zilu (Zi Lu - Cu Lo) bertanya hal keperwiraan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"nán","traditional":"南","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"běi","traditional":"北","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"抑","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Keperwiraan dari daerah Selatankah, keperwiraan dari daerah Utarakah, atau keperwiraan sejati?"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"宽","pinyin":"kuān","traditional":"寬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"róu","traditional":"柔","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiào","traditional":"教","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"报","pinyin":"bào","traditional":"報","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"nán","traditional":"南","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Dengan lemah lembut mendidik sesama, tidak membalas perbuatan yang ingkar dari Jalan Suci; itulah keperwiraan dari Selatan yang juga dipegang teguh oleh seorang Junzi - Kuncu. (S.S. XII:16)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"rèn","traditional":"衽","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"金","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gé","traditional":"革","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"sǐ","traditional":"死","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"厌","pinyin":"yàn","traditional":"厭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"běi","traditional":"北","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Rebah dengan tetap mengenakan pakaian perang dan senjata, mati dengan tidak menaruh sesal; itulah keperwiraan dari Utara yang juga dipegang teguh oleh seorang yang gagah berani."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"和","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"liú","traditional":"流","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"立","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"倚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"变","pinyin":"biàn","traditional":"變","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sāi","traditional":"塞","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sǐ","traditional":"死","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"变","pinyin":"biàn","traditional":"變","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu bersikap harmonis, tidak melanda; betapa perwira ia! Bersikap Tengah dalam pendirian dan tidak goyah, betapa perwira ia! Negara di dalam Jalan Suci ia tidak mengubah cita-cita, betapa perwira ia! Negara ingkar dari Jalan Suci, sekalipun binasa ia tidak berubah sikap, betapa perwira ia!\" TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB X (Yang Wajar Dan Tekun)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/10 - Bab IX - Keperwiraan.md","title":"Bab IX — Keperwiraan"}
